# OpenAPI spec — regenerated fresh from backend/services/api-gateway on
# every local build (see package.json's predev/prebuild), but also
# committed as-is: a standalone deploy (Vercel) of just this repo has no
# sibling backend/ to regenerate from, so predev/prebuild fall back to
# using whatever's already committed here instead of failing the build.
# Re-run `npm run build` locally and commit the result after an API
# change to keep this from going stale.
